   00212| /// table's routed fetch runs ahead of that row and deliberately does not
   00213| /// re-ask a verb recognizer, so it asks this instead: a request the
   00214| /// navigation vocabulary claims is advice to open a tab, not a fetch of the
   00215| /// page (the url-navigation ladder in `seed_and_memory`, issue #1138).
